] via Poly Pizza - \nHard hat by joney_lol [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza - ", "short_description": "Step into a vibrant VR world where mathematics meets mole mayhem! Dive deep into 'Whack-A-Math-Mole!', a thrilling game that transforms tedious times tables into a heart-pounding adventure. Why settle for traditional paper exercises when you can master your multiplication skills with a mallet in hand? Get ready for an exhilarating learning journey that's not just educational but explosively fun!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spatialinnovations.wixsite.com/mysite/whackamathmole-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spatial Innovations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spatialinnovations.wixsite.com/mysite", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25217241811195146"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_24391917290493522_8592386268124650110_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zCzHzZi59P0Q7kNvwGxuUzv&_nc_oc=Adq2l0xTl52lgzCkJZZTg8NgfJS8x8VqQWGAVCoy11zgjqWrr4iy0931EM4CyQSmsv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwlVdNeYMpubM5pyhDdzuNpXf2EriSezr-HhUu0APScwQ&oe=69C2777C"}